WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:42.800
Feel free to kill me if they want.

01:43.560 --> 01:46.520
Why should the innocent
Weibei Army soldiers be sacrificed?

01:52.400 --> 01:53.440
Your Highness,

01:54.440 --> 01:55.760
we share a common enemy.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.560
We can work together.

02:02.080 --> 02:03.680
Now that I've survived,

02:05.840 --> 02:07.040
I have the right to revenge.

02:08.600 --> 02:10.479
The lady only has one year left.

02:11.080 --> 02:13.120
Even if we manage to prepare the antidote,

02:13.200 --> 02:14.880
she might not survive until then.

02:16.080 --> 02:19.480
This path, I don't need an accomplice for.

02:21.600 --> 02:23.200
But I know where Zhang Yin is hiding.

02:28.000 --> 02:29.360
I saved you from the Imperial Prison.

02:29.440 --> 02:31.320
Is this how you repay me?

02:33.440 --> 02:34.440
I am of use to you.

02:34.520 --> 02:37.000
- I can help you, Your Highness.
- I don't need collaborators.

02:37.720 --> 02:39.360
What I need is a sharp blade.

02:39.920 --> 02:41.160
One that kills whoever I want dead.

02:41.240 --> 02:42.760
I don't kill the innocent.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.000
I only kill my enemies
in the Qingzhou affair.

02:46.120 --> 02:46.960
Your Highness,

02:47.040 --> 02:50.160
if I were just a tool,
you would have perished long ago.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.680
For revenge on Qingzhou,

02:51.760 --> 02:53.440
I am willing to be a sharp blade.

02:53.520 --> 02:55.400
Even if it means cutting myself.

02:55.480 --> 02:56.640
I have no regrets.

02:59.640 --> 03:02.080
Your Highness, Mr. Yue Qin has arrived.

03:07.880 --> 03:08.720
Your Highness.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.960
Are you here to take Mei Lin?

03:12.200 --> 03:13.080
Let's skip the pleasantries.

03:13.160 --> 03:14.880
What position do you have to demand her?

03:19.360 --> 03:20.520
His Majesty has decreed

03:20.600 --> 03:21.880
that the Xiyan beauties will be sent

03:21.960 --> 03:23.920
to the Court of State Ceremonial
to study the Yan customs and culture.

03:24.000 --> 03:26.360
Only after completing their studies
will they be distributed.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.840
I am in charge of these affairs.

03:30.320 --> 03:31.480
IMPERIAL EDICT

03:34.360 --> 03:35.280
Study?

03:36.960 --> 03:38.320
You should

03:38.400 --> 03:40.520
go through so much just to save her.

03:41.600 --> 03:42.440
Yes.

03:42.960 --> 03:44.160
I am here to save her.

03:44.240 --> 03:46.880
Since you have shown kindness,
please see it through to the end.

03:46.960 --> 03:47.880
Don't make it difficult for her.

03:48.480 --> 03:49.320
Difficult?

03:50.280 --> 03:51.120
Mei.

03:57.440 --> 03:58.840
Do you want to stay at my mansion

03:58.920 --> 04:01.120
or go with Mr. Yue Qin?

04:01.200 --> 04:02.760
It depends on you.

04:03.400 --> 04:04.240
Your Highness,

04:05.280 --> 04:07.400
I'd like to go
to the Court of State Ceremonial.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.640
Your Highness,

04:16.880 --> 04:18.160
I am under an imperial mandate.

04:18.240 --> 04:20.040
Please don't interfere.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.520
Very well.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.640
Since this has come so suddenly,

04:24.720 --> 04:26.520
let her freshen up first.

04:26.600 --> 04:28.200
I will send her over myself.

04:28.280 --> 04:29.240
I will wait here.

04:29.840 --> 04:31.360
Please take your time.

04:32.080 --> 04:32.920
Suit yourself, then.

04:50.760 --> 04:53.280
So, you want to work with him?

04:53.360 --> 04:54.560
Let me remind you,

04:54.640 --> 04:56.880
since you left the Imperial Prison,
whether dead or alive,

04:56.960 --> 04:58.360
you are mine.

04:59.240 --> 05:02.640
Relying on others
will only hasten your death.

05:02.720 --> 05:05.360
The more you depend on them,
the quicker you'll die.

05:05.440 --> 05:06.760
Don't worry.

05:08.000 --> 05:09.760
I won't depend on Mr. Yue Qin.

05:10.640 --> 05:12.280
Zhang Yin plans to flee to Xiyan.

05:12.360 --> 05:14.680
And his female accomplice is hiding
in the Court of State Ceremonial.

05:15.320 --> 05:17.880
Find her, and we'll find Zhang Yin.

05:19.000 --> 05:20.120
A Xiyan beauty?

05:21.360 --> 05:23.400
I didn't get a clear look at her face.

05:23.480 --> 05:27.160
But I did see a peony flower mark
on her neck.

05:27.800 --> 05:30.040
So, I must go back there with Mr. Yue Qin.

05:36.680 --> 05:40.320
From now on, follow orders strictly.

05:40.400 --> 05:43.400
What I say and do are all confidential.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.600
Do not disclose anything to anyone.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.560
You have agreed to work with me?

05:49.640 --> 05:50.680
One more thing.

05:51.480 --> 05:53.360
Don't keep any secrets from me.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.080
Deal.

05:56.760 --> 05:57.960
The first matter of our cooperation,

05:58.040 --> 06:00.080
tell me everything about your interactions

06:00.160 --> 06:02.080
with the Hostage Prince of Xiyan.

06:03.920 --> 06:05.360
When I was in Qingzhou,

06:05.880 --> 06:08.280
it was Mr. Yue Qin
who freed my family from slavery.

06:09.080 --> 06:10.240
He is a good man.

06:11.840 --> 06:12.720
And so are you.

06:16.280 --> 06:17.360
Self-righteous.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.200
I don't want to be a good man.

06:19.280 --> 06:21.280
Then why am I in your mansion?

06:23.560 --> 06:24.400
Don't you remember?

06:41.040 --> 06:44.280
- It was you who saved me.
- It was Qingyan, acting on his own,

06:44.880 --> 06:46.360
who picked you up
near the Wenhua Pavilion.

06:48.320 --> 06:49.160
In all,

06:50.080 --> 06:52.160
since you're still alive,
don't live in vain.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.680
Change your clothes

06:53.760 --> 06:55.720
and find the woman
hiding in the Court of State Ceremonial.

06:56.400 --> 06:57.480
Yes.

06:57.560 --> 06:58.560
Your Highness,

06:59.200 --> 07:00.480
it's getting late.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.400
One warm reminder.

07:05.000 --> 07:07.200
Those who seek revenge
have a blade over their neck.

07:07.800 --> 07:11.080
Either he hinders you
or you implicate him.

07:11.160 --> 07:14.000
In all, stay away from good people.

07:19.560 --> 07:22.240
QINGQU COURTYARD

07:23.280 --> 07:24.960
How did you know
I was in Prince Jing's mansion?

07:25.560 --> 07:28.000
Shumo saw you last night
get into the Prince's carriage.

07:32.320 --> 07:33.400
There are Imperial Guards

07:33.480 --> 07:34.880
assigned by the Emperor
in the Court of State Ceremonial.

07:34.960 --> 07:36.160
With them around,

07:36.240 --> 07:38.720
even Prince Jing
wouldn't dare act recklessly.

07:38.800 --> 07:40.280
You can rest assured staying here.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.960
Thank you so much.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.320
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

07:48.440 --> 07:50.920
Brother? Why are you here too?

07:51.720 --> 07:53.960
Did you know each other?

07:54.560 --> 07:55.440
Zigu,

07:55.520 --> 07:57.720
Mei Lin is the one I told you about.
The one who saved my life.

08:01.840 --> 08:05.120
Well, Zigu, were you looking for Mei Lin?

08:07.360 --> 08:10.240
Well, the Emperor allowed me
to come here to visit you.

08:10.320 --> 08:12.560
But when I went to your room,
you weren't there.

08:12.640 --> 08:14.040
So, I came to see Mei Lin first.

08:17.320 --> 08:19.160
Mei Lin, are you feeling better?

08:19.240 --> 08:20.880
- Have you used the ointment I gave you?
- I…

08:20.960 --> 08:22.520
Is Prince Jing
still giving you a hard time?

08:24.520 --> 08:27.160
I'm fine. Don't worry, Your Highness.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.320
Mei Lin.

08:30.400 --> 08:33.400
I didn't expect you
to be my brother's savior.

08:33.480 --> 08:35.120
No wonder I feel so close to you.

08:35.760 --> 08:38.240
- Let me tell you, my brother--
- Zigu, Mei Lin needs rest now.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.360
Let's go.

08:39.960 --> 08:41.039
What? Well…

08:41.120 --> 08:43.480
Excuse me then.
I'll come back to see you next time.

08:44.480 --> 08:45.520
Okay.

08:57.320 --> 08:59.760
Brother, It's her, isn't it?

09:00.600 --> 09:02.320
Brother, don't ignore me!

09:03.120 --> 09:06.280
Brother, If you don't say anything,
I'll take it as a yes.

09:06.360 --> 09:08.960
This is bamboo brew, made by me.

09:09.040 --> 09:10.480
Mei Lin must be the one
in your heart, right?

09:11.720 --> 09:14.120
I added your favorite sour berries.

09:14.200 --> 09:15.560
Want to try?

09:16.960 --> 09:18.480
Brother.

09:19.520 --> 09:22.360
You've been carving the little figure
in the image of Mei Lin, have you?

09:27.280 --> 09:29.800
Someone's shy and needs liquid courage.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.640
Zigu.

09:34.480 --> 09:37.160
Brother, am I getting
a sister-in-law soon?

09:38.240 --> 09:40.560
Do not worry. I like Mei Lin too.

09:40.640 --> 09:43.040
And you're such a good person.
She'll surely like you.

09:43.120 --> 09:46.560
Zigu, she's still a peace-making beauty.

09:48.040 --> 09:49.400
Oh, right.

09:49.480 --> 09:52.920
You've met again so late.
The timing isn't right.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.960
But don't worry, I can help you.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.000
No.

09:57.880 --> 10:00.040
I have my own plans.
You mustn't interfere.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.560
So, you've been teaching

10:04.640 --> 10:08.720
at the Court of State Ceremonial
to help Mei Lin?

10:08.800 --> 10:10.280
Will you bring her back to Xiyan?

10:16.320 --> 10:17.880
What can I do for you two?

10:19.280 --> 10:20.840
You take care of yourself, that's enough.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.040
Don't make me worry.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.560
Your Highness,

10:29.720 --> 10:30.800
it's time to return to the palace.

10:32.200 --> 10:33.440
I got it.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.880
Brother, I'm leaving now.

10:52.680 --> 10:54.000
Your Highness, are you really determined?

10:55.400 --> 10:57.600
Taking a peace-making beauty isn't easy,

10:58.360 --> 11:01.360
especially with Prince Jing
now watching her too.

11:02.080 --> 11:03.040
Precisely because of that,

11:03.720 --> 11:06.200
leaving Zhaojing is her only chance.

11:06.280 --> 11:09.560
You've never discussed politics
with the Yan Emperor,

11:10.360 --> 11:12.640
yet now you break that rule to save her.

11:12.720 --> 11:14.280
If this draws suspicion,

11:14.360 --> 11:16.400
you might never return to Xiyan.

11:18.800 --> 11:21.200
Your Highness, if I may speak,

11:22.320 --> 11:23.640
Mei Lin

11:25.160 --> 11:26.520
is not your fated match.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.160
She will always be one of the Great Yan,

11:29.240 --> 11:31.280
and she has great enemies too.

11:34.880 --> 11:36.160
I understand your concerns.

11:36.760 --> 11:37.960
From the beginning,

11:38.040 --> 11:39.840
I've only wanted
to protect those around me.

11:40.520 --> 11:42.280
Now, there's just one more.

11:44.120 --> 11:46.120
That's why we need to act carefully,

11:46.200 --> 11:49.160
without implicating Zigu
or leaving any trace.

11:50.440 --> 11:53.440
The priority is to prevent Mei Lin
from being assigned,

11:54.600 --> 11:56.560
to keep her
in the Court of State Ceremonial,

11:56.640 --> 11:57.560
so we can take action.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.560
My life is yours.

12:04.840 --> 12:07.920
Whatever you decide, I will follow.

12:08.720 --> 12:11.640
Whatever you want to do,
I'll do it for you.

12:12.400 --> 12:13.800
Just let me know.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.400
In these years in Zhaojing,

12:20.480 --> 12:21.920
thank you.

12:23.200 --> 12:25.560
But have you fallen ill?

12:26.680 --> 12:28.280
You look pale.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.640
It's cold.

12:35.720 --> 12:36.880
I've just caught a chill.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.520
No need to worry, Your Highness.

12:39.760 --> 12:41.880
Tomorrow,
the beauties will begin their studies.

12:41.960 --> 12:44.480
I'll make sure Mei Lin is taken care of.

12:51.120 --> 12:52.640
COURT OF STATE CEREMONIAL

12:52.720 --> 12:54.880
Beauties, it's time for class.

13:08.280 --> 13:10.480
I am Attendant Shang
from the Imperial Household Department.

13:11.120 --> 13:12.960
Here to teach you proper etiquette.

13:13.840 --> 13:17.120
I will only say the rules once.

13:17.200 --> 13:20.840
If you forget,
you'll be punished with ice water.

13:21.560 --> 13:24.720
Clear your minds, and remember well.

13:24.800 --> 13:28.080
No peony flower? Did I misremember?

13:31.240 --> 13:32.760
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

13:32.840 --> 13:33.680
My lord.

13:33.760 --> 13:35.080
We've searched
the entire Court of State Ceremonial,

13:35.160 --> 13:36.560
but there's no woman
with a peony flower mark.

13:37.400 --> 13:40.760
Did Mei Lin really see it,
or was she just seeing things?

14:16.400 --> 14:17.640
You were tasked with finding people,

14:18.240 --> 14:19.520
and this is how you do it?

14:23.560 --> 14:24.960
I haven't found her yet.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.000
I have a sneaking suspicion
that there was more to that night,

14:27.080 --> 14:28.240
but I can't quite remember.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.880
So, I tried soaking in cold water

14:30.960 --> 14:32.440
to see if I could recall anything else.

14:32.520 --> 14:33.960
Anything, then?

14:39.400 --> 14:41.880
You said that night,
it was General Qingyan who saved me,

14:43.240 --> 14:44.400
but I still can't remember it clearly.

14:48.400 --> 14:49.440
Qingyan checked.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.840
There is no such woman

14:51.920 --> 14:53.720
in the Court of State Ceremonial.

14:54.400 --> 14:55.520
I suspect

14:56.400 --> 14:57.600
you were hallucinating.

14:57.680 --> 14:59.120
Hallucinating?

14:59.200 --> 15:01.880
Taking too many Red Coix Seeds
can cause hallucinations.

15:02.600 --> 15:04.080
Last night, I saw it with my own eyes.

15:04.680 --> 15:06.400
You were hallucinating.

15:07.640 --> 15:09.040
Do you truly remember nothing?

15:13.760 --> 15:15.120
This concerns
the whereabouts of Zhang Yin.

15:15.800 --> 15:17.000
You must recall.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.360
Then I'll take the Red Coix Seed again.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.840
- Maybe it will help me remember.
- No.

15:21.920 --> 15:23.680
Do you think Red Coix Seed

15:23.760 --> 15:25.600
is something you can just find anywhere?

15:31.560 --> 15:32.960
It's not a good thing.

15:33.640 --> 15:34.680
You are not to take it again.

15:44.440 --> 15:46.040
In your hallucination,

15:46.640 --> 15:49.000
you mistook my hair for wildflowers.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.640
Remember?

16:06.600 --> 16:08.000
This is where you bit me.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.960
Bite it again.

16:23.440 --> 16:25.720
With this, someone will be there
to meet you.

16:25.800 --> 16:26.920
Thank you, Meiniang.

16:32.400 --> 16:34.720
The Formosan gum.
Its resin is slightly bitter,

16:34.800 --> 16:35.640
but it can stop bleeding.

16:35.720 --> 16:37.520
General Weibei was wronged.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.480
He shouldn't die.

16:38.560 --> 16:41.320
The one who should die is you,
the owner of Shadow Works.

16:41.920 --> 16:43.800
Little flower, go home with me.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.520
The flower is here.

16:47.720 --> 16:49.800
The Northern Snow Lotus Pill
neutralizes all toxins.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.600
Nanyang Red Coix Seed
neutralizes all toxins.

16:55.320 --> 16:56.760
You don't need to look for it anymore.

16:56.840 --> 16:58.320
I've found the Red Coix Seeds.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.400
Well?

17:27.960 --> 17:29.160
I've remembered everything.

17:29.880 --> 17:31.720
I started hallucinating
only after leaving the Wenhua Pavilion.

17:32.320 --> 17:33.760
That woman wasn't a hallucination.

17:53.240 --> 17:55.400
- The peony flower isn't a tattoo.
- It was painted on.

17:57.160 --> 18:00.480
The woman's neck
must have a noticeable scar.

18:01.320 --> 18:03.400
So, she used the peony to hide it.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.600
Keep looking for her.

18:12.280 --> 18:14.880
Red Coix Seed. You also searched for it?

18:17.920 --> 18:20.760
I went through a lot of trouble
to get you out of the Imperial Prison.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.840
If you were to die so soon,

18:23.560 --> 18:25.760
it would be a waste of my efforts.

18:28.000 --> 18:29.680
If you have important matters,

18:30.400 --> 18:31.880
use this to contact me.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.760
Running off to the Court
of State Ceremonial every day,

18:55.840 --> 18:57.560
what is that about?

18:58.880 --> 18:59.720
Father,

19:00.680 --> 19:03.680
I'm bored staying in the mansion all day.

19:03.760 --> 19:06.080
Going there to admire all the beauties

19:06.160 --> 19:07.520
at least brings me some pleasure.

19:07.600 --> 19:09.760
It's just a beauty, after all.

19:10.720 --> 19:13.040
And this one harbors resentment.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.120
You need to be cautious with her.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.400
Did you…

19:19.320 --> 19:20.480
upset Luomei again?

19:21.760 --> 19:22.920
Father, why is that?

19:23.000 --> 19:24.520
She just returned to the capital
after changing duties,

19:24.600 --> 19:26.880
then went straight
to the West Suburbs Barracks.

19:26.960 --> 19:30.640
Father, General Yin is fully devoted
to training troops for Great Yan.

19:30.720 --> 19:31.720
How could I dare interfere?

19:32.680 --> 19:35.520
Speaking of Luomei,
you two were childhood companions.

19:40.560 --> 19:42.320
Greetings, Father.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.600
Big Brother.

19:44.680 --> 19:47.400
Father, please find another chess partner.

19:47.480 --> 19:48.960
I'm no match for you.

19:49.040 --> 19:51.080
Your brother has business to attend to.

19:53.280 --> 19:55.080
Have you figured out
what happened at the Wenhua Pavilion?

19:55.160 --> 19:56.120
Yes, Father.

20:11.600 --> 20:13.400
- It was an accident?
- Yes, Father.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.480
That night was dry and windy.

20:15.560 --> 20:17.520
The servants at the Wenhua Pavilion
forgot to close the windows,

20:17.600 --> 20:18.600
letting the wind
knock over the candle stand.

20:19.520 --> 20:21.880
The pavilion was filled
with flammable artifacts and calligraphy.

20:21.960 --> 20:23.520
By the time the fire was discovered,
it was too late.

20:24.520 --> 20:28.120
What was Zhang Yin doing
at the Wenhua Pavilion so late at night?

20:30.240 --> 20:32.240
Zhou Yu, the Vice-Minister of Rites,
is from the same hometown as him.

20:32.320 --> 20:33.240
The two of them hit it off,

20:33.320 --> 20:34.640
plotting to steal the Xiyan tributes.

20:35.360 --> 20:36.680
They had not expected such an accident.

20:36.760 --> 20:38.840
Zhang Yin, driven by greed,
rushed back to retrieve the tributes,

20:39.480 --> 20:40.760
only to be trapped in the flames.

20:40.840 --> 20:42.640
All of this is Zhou Yu's confession.

20:48.800 --> 20:52.880
A second-rank official, coveting tributes,
risking his life for wealth.

20:53.640 --> 20:54.680
How amusing.

20:55.320 --> 20:56.440
Third Brother is right.

20:56.520 --> 20:59.080
But Zhang Yin has been stationed
in the military camps for years,

20:59.160 --> 21:00.520
with few opportunities to amass wealth.

21:00.600 --> 21:01.760
Returning to the capital
in the Ministry of Defense,

21:01.840 --> 21:04.000
he might have lost his resolve
and given in to temptation.

21:04.080 --> 21:05.640
Crown Prince,

21:06.440 --> 21:08.680
is this the man you promoted?

21:11.440 --> 21:13.680
Father, I failed to see through
his character.

21:14.360 --> 21:15.800
I am willing to accept punishment.

21:19.800 --> 21:21.080
Enough.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.360
As if this embarrassment isn't bad enough?

21:23.200 --> 21:24.520
Zhang Yin and Zhou Yu's affairs,

21:24.600 --> 21:26.000
deal with them as you see fit.

21:28.680 --> 21:30.160
Thank you, Father.

21:34.560 --> 21:37.720
Xiyan tributes were destroyed,
and I am responsible.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.720
I request to assist Mr. Yue Qin

21:39.800 --> 21:43.440
in organizing the studies
at the Court of State Ceremonial

21:43.520 --> 21:44.560
as a means of making amends.

21:46.920 --> 21:49.120
Father, I would also like to help
at the Court of State Ceremonial.

21:50.000 --> 21:51.000
This isn't something for fun.

21:54.520 --> 21:55.920
Father,

21:56.000 --> 21:58.520
Third Brother is familiar
with the peace-making delegation.

21:58.600 --> 22:00.280
I believe he can be of help.

22:00.880 --> 22:01.720
Yeah.

22:01.800 --> 22:03.840
Father, with Big Brother keeping
an eye on me,

22:03.920 --> 22:04.800
what do you have to worry about?

22:05.800 --> 22:07.080
Very well.

22:07.160 --> 22:10.280
Seeing the two of you getting along
brings me great comfort.

22:10.960 --> 22:12.880
I remember when you first started walking,

22:12.960 --> 22:13.840
you convinced your brother

22:13.920 --> 22:16.080
to sneak into the Imperial Study
and steal my cinnabar ink.

22:16.680 --> 22:19.960
The two of you pressed your handprints
all over the Rong'an Palace,

22:20.040 --> 22:21.560
the walls covered with red.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.000
Father's memory is sharp.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.320
I visited the palace recently,

22:25.400 --> 22:27.040
and the handprints are still there.

22:27.880 --> 22:28.880
Father misses Mother.

22:28.960 --> 22:32.400
The Rong'an Palace
remains just as it was, unchanged.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.800
Now that Jinghe has returned,

22:35.880 --> 22:37.480
you two

22:38.600 --> 22:39.880
should go visit it together.

22:41.120 --> 22:42.040
Yes, Father.

23:03.240 --> 23:05.160
MEMORIAL TO EMPRESS DEJIA OF GREAT YAN

23:31.400 --> 23:34.520
Mother, it wasn't me.

23:34.600 --> 23:36.440
I didn't break the embroidery frame.

23:36.520 --> 23:37.880
It wasn't me.

23:39.040 --> 23:40.320
It's been ten years.

23:41.120 --> 23:43.040
Mother, Third Brother finally comes back.

23:44.960 --> 23:47.200
I was the one
who accidentally broke the frame.

23:47.280 --> 23:49.440
But who knew, before I could explain,

23:49.520 --> 23:50.960
Mother punished you instead.

23:55.280 --> 23:57.840
Empress Dejia, feeling pity for me

23:58.800 --> 23:59.840
because my birth mom passed away early,

23:59.920 --> 24:01.520
was always partial to me.

24:03.240 --> 24:04.840
You always said I gave in to you.

24:06.560 --> 24:08.160
With Mother's kindness in my heart,

24:09.200 --> 24:10.680
how could I not yield to you?

24:15.680 --> 24:17.720
If you are so willing to yield,

24:18.920 --> 24:21.680
why not yield the position
of Crown Prince to me?

24:27.720 --> 24:30.120
Third Brother, don't be too reckless.

24:30.760 --> 24:31.600
What's wrong, Big Brother?

24:32.120 --> 24:33.360
Can't keep up the act anymore?

24:35.400 --> 24:37.200
You're upset and talking nonsense,

24:37.280 --> 24:38.600
so I'll let it go.

24:38.680 --> 24:41.800
As long as you're
still willing to call me brother,

24:44.560 --> 24:46.600
I will always be your big brother.

24:48.240 --> 24:50.240
No need to continue this farce
of brotherly affection,

24:51.000 --> 24:52.720
Crown Prince.

24:52.800 --> 24:54.520
I'm tired of playing the role too.

24:54.600 --> 24:57.280
Prince Jing, what do you have to say?

24:59.560 --> 25:01.000
Now that Zhang Yin is dead,

25:01.600 --> 25:03.040
you've won this round.

25:04.840 --> 25:05.880
However,

25:06.920 --> 25:09.320
no one wins forever.

25:09.400 --> 25:11.080
It seems you've returned to the capital

25:11.160 --> 25:12.320
with the sole intention
of seizing the throne.

25:12.400 --> 25:14.680
Seizing? That's a bit too harsh.

25:15.320 --> 25:17.200
Coming from you, Crown Prince,

25:17.280 --> 25:19.960
it seems you're quite familiar
with the art.

25:20.040 --> 25:21.960
Pretending to be disabled for ten years,

25:22.040 --> 25:23.880
constantly playing the victim,

25:23.960 --> 25:26.000
your tactics
are no less cunning than mine.

25:26.080 --> 25:28.360
But no matter what,
the heir to the throne of Great Yan

25:28.440 --> 25:30.720
will never be a mass murderer like you.

25:31.600 --> 25:33.560
Who's truly the mass murderer?

25:34.160 --> 25:35.720
You and I both know the answer.

25:48.200 --> 25:51.720
Do you know how Mother died?

26:03.360 --> 26:06.560
When news of the Qingzhou massacre
reached Zhaojing,

26:07.160 --> 26:10.760
Empress Dejia went to the Yanming Palace
and begged for forgiveness.

26:15.600 --> 26:16.880
Even on her deathbed,

26:17.480 --> 26:19.680
she was embroidering a screen
to atone for you.

26:21.960 --> 26:23.360
As a woman from a military family,

26:23.440 --> 26:25.120
she lived to protect the empire.

26:27.080 --> 26:29.200
But she gave birth to a son
who slaughtered civilians.

26:30.880 --> 26:32.360
She was deeply ashamed.

26:39.160 --> 26:42.480
She met her end in melancholy
because of you.

26:48.040 --> 26:49.960
A criminal in the eyes of his own mother.

26:51.480 --> 26:54.160
How do you have the right to challenge me?

27:07.600 --> 27:08.600
A criminal?

27:10.680 --> 27:12.440
Right and wrong

27:13.640 --> 27:16.280
aren't defined solely by the victors.

27:19.560 --> 27:22.000
What you've stolen from me,

27:22.720 --> 27:26.280
I will reclaim in full.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.200
In time,

27:29.120 --> 27:32.520
who the real criminal is will be clear.

27:50.000 --> 27:51.240
Your Highness.

27:53.280 --> 27:54.840
Your Highness, bad news.

27:55.600 --> 27:56.520
What?

27:57.360 --> 27:59.320
A woman fled
from the Wenhua Pavilion that night.

27:59.960 --> 28:02.040
We tracked her to the Court
of State Ceremonial, but she vanished.

28:02.120 --> 28:04.640
She bears the marks of Xiyan martial arts.

28:04.720 --> 28:06.280
Why wasn't this reported sooner?

28:06.360 --> 28:07.840
It's my fault
for not disciplining the men.

28:08.440 --> 28:11.040
They feared punishment
and thought they could cover it up.

28:21.600 --> 28:22.840
What happened has happened.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.960
Even if you wipe it off now,
everyone has already noticed it.

28:26.800 --> 28:27.680
I'm willing to accept my punishment.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.800
Enough. Get up.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.360
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:37.200 --> 28:39.440
That woman is the witness
to the Wenhua Pavilion fire.

28:39.520 --> 28:41.880
Find her, and leave no evidence behind.

28:42.800 --> 28:45.560
That woman was wounded
by a fire arrow on her wrist.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.000
,It won't be difficult to locate her.

28:47.080 --> 28:48.440
But if she's a Xiyan beauty…

28:48.520 --> 28:49.960
No matter who she is.

28:50.040 --> 28:52.960
If anyone inquires about
the Wenhua Pavilion,

28:53.040 --> 28:54.400
those involved
won't need their heads anymore.

28:55.200 --> 28:57.600
Let Attendant Shang handle this.

28:58.560 --> 28:59.400
Yes, Your Highness.

29:01.520 --> 29:02.560
Wait.

29:12.840 --> 29:14.120
The nights have been getting colder.

29:14.720 --> 29:16.520
I've got a new silver fox fur cloak.

29:17.520 --> 29:20.240
You want to send it to General Yin
at the West Suburbs Barracks?

29:23.280 --> 29:24.680
Deliver it yourself.

29:24.760 --> 29:27.000
Understood.
I'll take care of it immediately.

29:34.440 --> 29:36.080
Embroidery is so difficult.

29:39.040 --> 29:40.080
Indeed,

29:41.080 --> 29:42.400
holding a needle is harder
than holding a sword.

29:43.560 --> 29:44.680
Time for class.

29:46.560 --> 29:47.560
Let's go.

29:49.760 --> 29:50.880
Hurry up.

29:50.960 --> 29:51.880
Go.

29:53.920 --> 29:55.560
Still no sign of anyone with the scar.

29:59.400 --> 30:03.000
Embroidery is a skill all women
of Great Yan must learn.

30:03.080 --> 30:05.360
Our Empress Dejia

30:05.440 --> 30:07.840
was a renowned master of needlework.

30:09.720 --> 30:10.880
This embroidery, "Instruct the Young",

30:10.960 --> 30:13.720
is one of her final works
before she passed.

30:14.400 --> 30:17.200
The Ministry of Rites placed this
in the Court of State Ceremonial,

30:18.000 --> 30:20.600
so everyone could study it closely,

30:20.680 --> 30:22.840
to follow the Empress's example

30:22.920 --> 30:24.800
and strive for perfection in all things.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.640
Surrender!

30:29.720 --> 30:30.560
EMPRESS DEJIA

30:30.640 --> 30:31.640
- Surrender.
- Jinghe.

30:32.320 --> 30:33.320
Don't.

30:41.280 --> 30:44.160
A general of Great Yan
only wields his sword to slay enemies.

30:45.920 --> 30:49.320
Never to harm his family or friends.

30:50.080 --> 30:52.360
Nor should he hurt innocent civilians.

30:53.040 --> 30:54.160
Remember that.

31:09.960 --> 31:11.320
Beauties, take a good look at this.

31:19.280 --> 31:20.680
"Instruct the Young"?

31:20.760 --> 31:21.760
Who was she instructing?

31:21.840 --> 31:23.840
Empress Dejia was Prince Jing's mother.

31:24.400 --> 31:26.600
It's about the Qingzhou massacre.

31:27.240 --> 31:29.280
They say the Empress died
from the shame of it.

31:29.360 --> 31:31.240
Instruct? Instruct who?

31:31.320 --> 31:33.680
Do not point blades at the people.

31:34.240 --> 31:36.640
These were your teachings, Mother.

31:38.720 --> 31:39.880
But why,

31:40.920 --> 31:43.120
even until your death,
did you refuse to trust me?

31:43.200 --> 31:45.720
You still begged for me.
You admitted fault on my behalf.

31:58.560 --> 32:01.040
CHANGXI PAVILION

32:24.960 --> 32:25.880
Mother,

32:28.160 --> 32:29.960
why didn't you believe in me?

32:40.640 --> 32:41.560
Come inside.

32:52.760 --> 32:55.120
I made it, like you said,
with added licorice root.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.720
Dengguo Cakes?

32:58.280 --> 32:59.760
You're from Qingzhou, aren't you?

33:00.640 --> 33:02.720
- I…
- I'm right.

33:03.320 --> 33:05.360
Do not worry. I won't tell anyone.

33:06.280 --> 33:09.040
These past few days, I've noticed
that you've been looking troubled.

33:09.920 --> 33:11.760
Are you homesick?

33:12.920 --> 33:14.400
Here's a taste of home. Try it.

33:25.840 --> 33:26.680
Is it sour?

33:29.160 --> 33:30.040
No, not at all.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.000
How can you stomach something so bitter?

33:40.080 --> 33:41.280
Bitter?

33:42.000 --> 33:44.880
Did you grind the roots and stems
along with the leaves?

33:47.920 --> 33:50.160
I'm so foolish.
I should've asked you first.

33:51.080 --> 33:51.920
Don't eat it anymore.

33:52.000 --> 33:54.080
Give it to me,
and I'll make a new batch tomorrow.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.080
It's not bitter.

33:55.160 --> 33:56.440
It is bitter. Stop eating it.

33:57.080 --> 33:58.000
Give it to me.

34:02.600 --> 34:03.760
What happened to your wrist?

34:04.880 --> 34:05.960
It's nothing.

34:06.040 --> 34:08.600
I burned it
while making the Dengguo cakes.

34:08.679 --> 34:09.719
I've already applied medicine.

34:10.719 --> 34:11.639
It looks serious.

34:12.239 --> 34:13.080
It's not serious.

34:13.920 --> 34:15.760
Don't eat the bitter cake.

34:16.639 --> 34:17.800
I like it.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.920
It's not bitter.

34:28.600 --> 34:30.480
Your voice sounds off.

34:31.320 --> 34:32.679
What's wrong with your throat?

34:37.880 --> 34:40.320
Maybe I caught a cold.

34:41.800 --> 34:42.840
Really?

34:43.480 --> 34:44.880
Actually…

34:47.120 --> 34:48.800
it's from taking this.

34:51.800 --> 34:53.560
WHITENING PILL

34:53.639 --> 34:55.920
This pill is meant to whiten the skin.

34:56.000 --> 34:58.320
But for two hours after taking it,

34:58.400 --> 35:00.200
my voice becomes thin.

35:03.960 --> 35:05.840
Men prefer fair skin.

35:06.520 --> 35:10.560
Last year, my father found me a match,

35:10.640 --> 35:12.080
but the man thought I was too dark.

35:12.160 --> 35:14.040
My father was so angry
that he broke off the engagement.

35:14.720 --> 35:15.960
Actually,

35:16.040 --> 35:17.760
I should have held it back.

35:17.840 --> 35:21.440
Father said,
if we'd given him a few more cows,

35:21.520 --> 35:23.280
I wouldn't have had to come
to Great Yan for this marriage.

35:24.040 --> 35:25.280
Don't listen to them.

35:26.120 --> 35:27.440
I think…

35:29.240 --> 35:30.280
you look better with darker skin.

35:30.360 --> 35:31.240
I look better with fairer skin.

35:31.320 --> 35:32.800
No, your darker skin is beautiful.

35:34.800 --> 35:37.280
Oh, I've been taking these pills
for days now.

35:37.360 --> 35:39.440
Look. Do you think I've become fairer?

35:40.960 --> 35:41.840
Yes.

35:41.920 --> 35:43.240
- Really?
- Really.

35:43.320 --> 35:45.080
This pill works,
so you should take it too.

35:47.080 --> 35:49.920
Forget it. You are already fair enough.

35:50.000 --> 35:50.880
No need to take it.

35:52.520 --> 35:53.360
But I also want to be fairer.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.200
Take the whole bottle.

35:57.920 --> 35:58.920
I'm leaving now.

36:01.480 --> 36:03.000
- Goodbye.
- Okay.

36:04.080 --> 36:08.000
Oh, Mei, from now on,
don't eat anything dark.

36:08.080 --> 36:10.320
Eating dark foods will make you darker.

36:10.400 --> 36:12.160
Eating dark foods will make me darker?

36:28.400 --> 36:30.480
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

36:30.560 --> 36:33.840
My lord, these are the Whitening Pills
from Mei Lin.

36:45.520 --> 36:46.520
Eat it.

36:46.600 --> 36:48.240
I'm not…

36:52.120 --> 36:53.320
I'm not dark.

36:53.400 --> 36:56.200
Mei Lin said that after taking these,
your voice will become thin.

36:56.280 --> 36:58.480
I want to know just how thin it will get.

36:59.120 --> 36:59.960
Well,

37:00.920 --> 37:02.000
will my voice return to normal?

37:02.080 --> 37:04.320
If not, I'll reward you with a poison
that mutes you forever.

37:07.000 --> 37:08.000
How do you feel?

37:08.800 --> 37:10.120
My throat…

37:11.200 --> 37:13.480
just feels a bit dry.

37:14.520 --> 37:15.360
My lord.

37:19.800 --> 37:21.480
This is right.

37:22.160 --> 37:23.800
The woman Mei Lin saw

37:24.440 --> 37:26.760
was actually a man in disguise.

37:27.680 --> 37:30.560
That peony flower must've been painted
to conceal his Adam's apple.

37:31.240 --> 37:32.080
A man?

37:33.960 --> 37:36.400
My lord, I might be better off
taking the poison.

37:38.520 --> 37:40.920
Relax. The effect only lasts
for two hours.

37:44.600 --> 37:46.640
My lord, I've uncovered something.

37:46.720 --> 37:48.320
The Attendant Shang you saw before

37:48.400 --> 37:50.160
does indeed have connections
to the Eastern Palace.

37:50.240 --> 37:51.760
Our men followed her for several days

37:51.840 --> 37:54.000
and discovered that she's been
using her embroidery lessons

37:54.080 --> 37:56.120
as a cover to search for a woman
with an injured wrist.

37:56.960 --> 38:01.200
It seems the Crown Prince
is also hunting for her.

38:02.320 --> 38:05.120
But now we know
the injured one is actually a man.

38:05.200 --> 38:07.120
We've gained the upper hand.

38:07.200 --> 38:08.120
Rest assured, my lord.

38:08.200 --> 38:09.720
I'll send people to search
the Court of State Ceremonial.

38:13.040 --> 38:15.240
Since they are looking

38:16.120 --> 38:18.000
for women with wrist injuries,

38:18.080 --> 38:21.280
let's send them a few more candidates.

38:41.000 --> 38:41.920
Are you okay?

39:04.560 --> 39:06.160
Dai overslept again.

39:06.240 --> 39:07.600
Attendant Shang will surely scold her.

39:07.680 --> 39:09.840
Indeed, we should go wake her.

39:13.000 --> 39:15.080
Dai, wake up.

39:15.880 --> 39:18.480
If you're late,
the attendant will mark you down,

39:18.560 --> 39:20.240
and you won't find a good match.

39:20.320 --> 39:21.880
She's close with Mei Lin.

39:21.960 --> 39:25.680
Maybe the two of them already planned
to serve Prince Jing together.

39:27.480 --> 39:29.320
Dai, wake up.

39:30.000 --> 39:30.960
Dai?

39:32.720 --> 39:33.800
Dai?

39:34.600 --> 39:35.440
Dai?

39:40.120 --> 39:41.680
What's going on?

39:41.760 --> 39:42.880
YAYUN PAVILION

39:44.560 --> 39:45.920
Dai is dead?

39:48.160 --> 39:49.160
How come?

39:55.200 --> 39:56.040
Sir.

39:57.760 --> 39:59.200
Mei Lin. The coroner has arrived.

40:25.560 --> 40:28.120
Sir, this is the Golden Monkey Mushroom,

40:28.200 --> 40:30.480
named for its blackish-gold color.

40:30.560 --> 40:33.880
It mostly grows in Great Yan,
rarely in Xiyan.

40:33.960 --> 40:36.480
This young lady consumed it,

40:36.560 --> 40:38.480
causing her to die of poisoning.

40:45.560 --> 40:48.440
Why were poisonous mushrooms found
in the Court of State Ceremonial?

40:49.040 --> 40:51.480
We'd never purchase poisonous items.

40:51.560 --> 40:53.480
It's been raining for several days,

40:53.560 --> 40:56.320
and damp places are prone
to growing Golden Monkey Mushrooms.

40:56.400 --> 40:59.560
It could be the servants were negligent,

40:59.640 --> 41:01.880
failing to clear them out in time.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.400
That's how

41:04.560 --> 41:06.960
Dai must have mistakenly eaten one.

41:18.160 --> 41:20.720
Dai died from ingesting
a poisonous mushroom.

41:21.320 --> 41:22.920
There are no assassins
in the Court of State Ceremonial.

41:24.720 --> 41:25.680
Remember,

41:25.760 --> 41:28.320
from now on, don't eat anything dark.

41:28.400 --> 41:31.040
Eating dark foods will make you darker.

41:32.720 --> 41:34.640
Dai would never have eaten
something like that.

41:35.440 --> 41:36.280
Send the words.

41:37.000 --> 41:40.560
Remove all Golden Monkey Mushrooms
from the Court of State Ceremonial.

41:41.640 --> 41:43.480
As for Dai, give her a proper burial.

41:44.440 --> 41:45.600
Yes.

42:14.080 --> 42:17.640
I will find the one who killed you.

42:36.160 --> 42:37.200
Why did you poison Dai?

42:37.280 --> 42:39.520
Please, don't kill me.

42:39.600 --> 42:40.840
Dai, she…

42:40.920 --> 42:43.440
she poisoned herself
by eating those mushrooms.

42:43.520 --> 42:44.760
Tell me the truth,

42:44.840 --> 42:47.040
or I'll make you
eat all the mushrooms yourself.

42:47.120 --> 42:49.160
No, please. Fine. I'll talk.

42:50.320 --> 42:52.320
They… They told me to find a woman

42:52.400 --> 42:53.720
who left the Court of State Ceremonial
on the night of the eighth.

42:53.800 --> 42:55.640
The woman had a burn on her wrist.
I found Dai,

42:55.720 --> 42:56.840
but they said I had the wrong person.

42:56.920 --> 42:58.600
Yet Dai clearly had a burn on her wrist.

42:58.680 --> 43:01.520
Then they told me to keep searching.

43:01.600 --> 43:02.440
"They"?

43:03.160 --> 43:04.000
Who are "they"?

43:04.080 --> 43:07.920
I… I really don't know.

43:08.000 --> 43:09.160
Who are you?

43:34.160 --> 43:36.080
Don't eat the bitter cake.

43:36.160 --> 43:37.560
I'll make a new batch tomorrow.

43:40.040 --> 43:42.720
I made it, like you said,
with added licorice root.

43:44.120 --> 43:45.880
Are you homesick?

43:46.800 --> 43:49.000
Here's a taste of home. Try it.

44:38.320 --> 44:39.480
What's happening?

44:39.560 --> 44:40.760
My lord,

44:42.680 --> 44:44.520
a Xiyan beauty died today.

44:45.760 --> 44:47.680
She had a burn on her right wrist.

44:48.200 --> 44:49.680
She was mistakenly killed
by Attendant Shang.

44:57.040 --> 44:58.920
Is Attendant Shang
searching for the same person as us?

44:59.800 --> 45:00.640
Yes.

45:00.720 --> 45:02.440
Who's behind her?

45:02.520 --> 45:04.280
Is this connected
to the Qingzhou massacre?

45:08.160 --> 45:09.600
We need to find Zhang Yin,

45:10.120 --> 45:11.160
only then,

45:11.760 --> 45:13.240
will the truth be revealed.

45:13.320 --> 45:15.400
Since they know
they killed the wrong person,

45:16.600 --> 45:17.920
they will keep searching.

45:18.880 --> 45:20.280
And if they can't find her,

45:21.200 --> 45:22.760
they'll kill more innocents.

45:23.680 --> 45:25.280
Then, let them kill me.

45:30.120 --> 45:31.640
I will be the bait.

45:31.720 --> 45:34.960
I'll make them believe I am the woman
who fled the Wenhua Pavilion.

45:45.880 --> 45:48.200
I can't bear to see another Dai

45:49.040 --> 45:50.800
die in front of me.

45:52.880 --> 45:54.240
You've been to the Wenhua Pavilion.

45:55.560 --> 45:57.600
You are indeed the perfect bait.
